WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:04.167
-A reporter for the right-wing
network Newsmax asked,

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:06.434
at a White House briefing,
if Joe Biden is woke;

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:08.734
Marjorie Taylor Greene said
whales are being killed

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:09.734
by wind turbines;

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:11.801
and a Fox host claimed pot smoke

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:13.501
is an environmental disaster,

00:00:13.501 --> 00:00:16.000
all while an actual
environmental disaster,

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.868
the catastrophic train
derailment in Ohio,

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:19.767
continues to upend
the lives of residents

00:00:19.767 --> 00:00:21.200
and pose significant
health risks.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.334
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:27.400
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.968
Ever since Donald Trump emerged
on the political scene,

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:31.934
Republicans have tried
to rebrand themselves

00:00:31.934 --> 00:00:34.534
as a populist party
that represents the interests

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.801
of blue-collar,
working-class Americans.

00:00:36.801 --> 00:00:39.801
-The forgotten men and women
of our country

00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:42.567
-Whoo!
-will be forgotten no longer.

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:44.968
-We are a pro-America,
populist party

00:00:44.968 --> 00:00:47.067
rooted in conservative
principle,

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.701
with Donald Trump
as our leader.

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:49.868
-We're in favor of

00:00:49.868 --> 00:00:51.968
an America First
economic policy,

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:53.934
an America First foreign policy,

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:56.133
and that means doing what's good
for the American worker.

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:59.467
-The Republican Party is
the party of steel workers

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:02.801
and construction workers
and pipeline workers

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:04.801
[ Cheering and applause ]
and taxicab drivers

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:06.701
and cops and firefighters

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:08.767
and waiters and waitresses

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:11.100
and the men and women
with calluses on their hands!

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.634
-Ugh! I have calluses
on my ears,

00:01:12.634 --> 00:01:14.167
just listening to that.

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:16.634
[ Laughter ]
My God, man, have you heard
your own voice?

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:18.701
Ted Cruz is like the dude
in your high school band

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:20.467
who insists
on taking lead vocals.

00:01:20.467 --> 00:01:22.234
[ Laughter ]
[ As Cruz ] Don't worry, guys.
I got this.

00:01:22.234 --> 00:01:24.400
♪ It's been one week
since you looked at me ♪

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.834 --> 00:01:29.467
Just listing off a bunch
of random blue-collar jobs,

00:01:29.467 --> 00:01:31.200
like he got them
from a Richard Scarry book.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:33.501
[ As Cruz ]
We need to protect
our construction workers,

00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:35.133
our firefighters,

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:37.734
and our worms
who drive apple cars!

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:39.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:40.901
You could tell he's just making
it up as he goes

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:42.501
because he left off so many
other jobs,

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:45.267
like truckers, teachers, nurses,
retail workers, farmers,

00:01:45.267 --> 00:01:47.133
although he did mention
taxicab drivers,

00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:49.667
because he has personal
experience with them.

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:51.501
[ New York accent ]
Hey, back to the airport,
Mr. Cruz?

00:01:51.501 --> 00:01:52.767
Must be a snowstorm coming.

00:01:52.767 --> 00:01:55.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:58.367
And, yeah, even in Texas,
the taxi drivers talk like that.

00:01:58.367 --> 00:02:00.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.067 --> 00:02:01.767
Okay, dude?

00:02:01.767 --> 00:02:03.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.567 --> 00:02:05.200
Of course, I probably
don't need to tell you

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.234
that faux populism
was all a show.

00:02:07.234 --> 00:02:08.601
In the four years
Trump held office,

00:02:08.601 --> 00:02:11.067
Republicans accomplished
exactly one thing of note,

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:13.767
which was an extravagant tax cut
that lavished millions

00:02:13.767 --> 00:02:15.133
on the wealthy and corporations.

00:02:15.133 --> 00:02:17.767
And then, when they won
a narrow majority in the House

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:19.968
and made it through
an excruciating series of votes

00:02:19.968 --> 00:02:20.968
to elect a new speaker,

00:02:20.968 --> 00:02:23.934
Republicans had a chance
to finally prove

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:25.467
their new working-class
bona fides.

00:02:25.467 --> 00:02:28.067
Instead, one of their first
hearings was about this.

00:02:28.067 --> 00:02:29.133
-You may have collaborated

00:02:29.133 --> 00:02:31.000
with the U.S.
intelligence community

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.100
regarding stories that y'all
didn't want the public to see.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:37.000
So, namely, what we refer to as
the Hunter Biden laptop story.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:40.133
-Hunter Biden's lawyers,
as recently as last week,

00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:43.701
wrote the Department of Justice
about Hunter Biden's laptop.

00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:46.801
-The substance of Hunter Biden's
laptop story.

00:02:46.801 --> 00:02:49.534
-FBI subpoenaed
Hunter Biden's laptop.

00:02:49.534 --> 00:02:51.200
-Regarding
Hunter Biden's laptop.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.234
-Hunter Biden's laptop.
-Hunter Biden laptop.

00:02:53.234 --> 00:02:54.801
-Hunter Biden laptop.
-Hunter Biden laptop.

00:02:54.801 --> 00:02:57.133
-Hunter Biden laptop.
-Hunter Biden laptop.

00:02:57.133 --> 00:03:00.367
[ Laughter ]
Maybe Hunter Biden's laptop is
the GOP's safe word.

00:03:00.367 --> 00:03:02.434
[ Laughter ]
They're repeating it

00:03:02.434 --> 00:03:04.501
like an undercover cop who's
in danger.

00:03:04.501 --> 00:03:06.634
[ Italian accent ]
Hey, what are you talking about?
I'm not a cop.

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:08.267
I'm a drug dealer,
just like you.

00:03:08.267 --> 00:03:10.367
Hunter's laptop, Hunter's
laptop, Hunter's laptop.

00:03:10.367 --> 00:03:12.200
[ Laughter ]
Get me outta here.
[Indistinct] laptop.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:13.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.667 --> 00:03:16.300
That's because Republicans have
no discernible governing agenda.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.067
They claim they're the party
of the working class,

00:03:18.067 --> 00:03:21.667
but they don't actually have
any ideas for or interest in

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:23.300
improving the lives
of working-class people.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.767
And you can see that
in the GOP's reaction

00:03:25.767 --> 00:03:27.501
to the catastrophic
train derailment

00:03:27.501 --> 00:03:29.601
and ensuing environmental
disaster in Ohio.

00:03:29.601 --> 00:03:31.033
-Train carrying chemicals,

00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:34.300
including a toxic flammable gas
called vinyl chloride,

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:37.000
derailed near
the Ohio-Pennsylvania border

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.367
earlier this month.

00:03:38.367 --> 00:03:41.234
That, in turn, started a fire
and then they had to do

00:03:41.234 --> 00:03:43.968
a sort of controlled release
of some of those chemicals,

00:03:43.968 --> 00:03:46.934
which blanketed the town
of East Palestine, Ohio,

00:03:46.934 --> 00:03:48.434
in noxious smoke.

00:03:48.434 --> 00:03:50.968
-About 50 cars operated
by Norfolk Southern came

00:03:50.968 --> 00:03:54.367
off their track and crumpled
into a smoldering pile.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:56.501
Ten of the cars
carried hazardous materials,

00:03:56.501 --> 00:03:57.968
according to the rail operator.

00:03:57.968 --> 00:03:59.467
The vinyl chloride,
in particular,

00:03:59.467 --> 00:04:01.100
is highly flammable

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:03.267
and crews ignited it
to burn it off

00:04:03.267 --> 00:04:06.100
in what they called
a controlled environment.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.601
That, in turn, produced
a huge plume of smoke

00:04:08.601 --> 00:04:11.868
and, with it, serious health
and environmental concerns.

00:04:11.868 --> 00:04:14.300
-There have been numerous
reports in recent days

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:18.601
of respiratory issues,
burning eyes, and dead wildlife,

00:04:18.601 --> 00:04:23.167
including at least
3,500 confirmed dead fish killed

00:04:23.167 --> 00:04:24.467
by contamination.

00:04:24.467 --> 00:04:27.400
-We basically nuked a town
with chemicals,

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:29.100
so we could get
a railroad open.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:32.000
-Holy [bleep], a mushroom cloud
of toxic chemicals

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.434
was released
over an entire town,

00:04:33.434 --> 00:04:35.701
killing thousands of fish
and causing respiratory issues.

00:04:35.701 --> 00:04:38.434
Of course, when Republicans
see a plume of gray smoke,

00:04:38.434 --> 00:04:40.133
their first thought is,
"Dear God!

00:04:40.133 --> 00:04:40.868
Did someone open..."

00:04:40.868 --> 00:04:41.968
-Hunter Biden's laptop?

00:04:41.968 --> 00:04:45.100
[ Laughter and applause ]
Obviously,

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.601
This is a catastrophe
that demands urgent action

00:04:47.601 --> 00:04:49.033
and the residents
of East Palestine

00:04:49.033 --> 00:04:51.567
must get all the help
and resources they need

00:04:51.567 --> 00:04:53.601
and the rail company
responsible, Norfolk Southern,

00:04:53.601 --> 00:04:55.567
which is worth over $50 billion,

00:04:55.567 --> 00:04:57.400
is under intense public pressure
to do more.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.200
For example...

00:05:07.534 --> 00:05:10.801
I'm sorry,
a $1,000 inconvenience check?

00:05:10.801 --> 00:05:11.934
Having to flee your home

00:05:11.934 --> 00:05:13.667
to avoid a mushroom cloud
of toxic chemicals

00:05:13.667 --> 00:05:15.734
is not an inconvenience.
It's a disaster.

00:05:15.734 --> 00:05:18.734
An inconvenience is
when you get stuck in the rain

00:05:18.734 --> 00:05:19.601
and can't hail a...

00:05:19.601 --> 00:05:20.734
-Taxicab!

00:05:20.734 --> 00:05:23.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:23.334 --> 00:05:26.167
[ Italian accent ]
Eh, no need to yell, Mr. Cruz.

00:05:26.167 --> 00:05:30.234
[ Laughter ]

00:05:30.234 --> 00:05:32.334
Yeah, I'm from Dallas!

00:05:32.334 --> 00:05:34.200
[ Laughter ]

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.701
Now, Norfolk Southern
has announced a new round

00:05:36.701 --> 00:05:38.734
of financial assistance
to help residents,

00:05:38.734 --> 00:05:40.601
pledging at least $1 million,

00:05:40.601 --> 00:05:42.901
but that still pales
in comparison

00:05:42.901 --> 00:05:44.367
to how much cash
the company has.

00:05:44.367 --> 00:05:46.067
Just a few weeks ago,
the company reported the...

00:05:55.367 --> 00:05:57.667
That's billion, with a "B,"

00:05:57.667 --> 00:05:59.801
and they expect residents
to be happy with $1 million?

00:05:59.801 --> 00:06:02.067
When they announced
the community relief fund,

00:06:02.067 --> 00:06:03.534
did they say,
"Great news, everyone,

00:06:03.534 --> 00:06:04.801
you're getting a grand total
of..."

00:06:04.801 --> 00:06:06.734
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:06:06.734 --> 00:06:09.267
-$1 million.

00:06:09.267 --> 00:06:11.300
[ Laughter ]
-And by the way,
rail workers and their unions

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.234
have been warning, for years,

00:06:13.234 --> 00:06:14.968
about deteriorating
safety conditions

00:06:14.968 --> 00:06:16.467
and demanding better
work standards.

00:06:16.467 --> 00:06:18.767
Instead, these massively
profitable rail companies

00:06:18.767 --> 00:06:21.267
poured money into stock buybacks
and dividends

00:06:21.267 --> 00:06:24.033
and lobbied for safety
regulations to be repealed.

00:06:24.033 --> 00:06:26.000
For example, in 2018,

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.133
the Trump administration rolled
back a train braking rule meant

00:06:29.133 --> 00:06:32.901
to keep oil tankers
from exploding near communities.

00:06:32.901 --> 00:06:34.934
I mean,
of [bleep] course he did.

00:06:34.934 --> 00:06:37.534
[ Laughter ]
And I'm sure we didn't hear
about it

00:06:37.534 --> 00:06:39.868
because it was the same day
he tried to buy Greenland

00:06:39.868 --> 00:06:42.601
or challenged Angela Merkel
to a putting contest

00:06:42.601 --> 00:06:44.200
or drank water weird.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:48.033
[ Laughter ]
We've been done a disservice
by movies that taught us

00:06:48.033 --> 00:06:50.234
evil guys were all geniuses
and scientists

00:06:50.234 --> 00:06:52.200
and we forgot
you can be an evil dummy

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.767
in a ballcap that doesn't fit.

00:06:53.767 --> 00:06:55.234
[ Laughter ]

00:06:55.234 --> 00:06:56.934
What else did Trump do
while we weren't looking?

00:06:56.934 --> 00:06:58.467
I wouldn't be shocked
to read a headline that said...

00:07:02.367 --> 00:07:04.133
[ Laughter ]

00:07:04.133 --> 00:07:06.734
[ As Trump ]
We don't have damsels anymore
and it's very sad.

00:07:06.734 --> 00:07:07.767
It's very sad.

00:07:07.767 --> 00:07:08.968
[ Laughter ]

00:07:08.968 --> 00:07:10.267
Because, with no damsels,

00:07:10.267 --> 00:07:12.667
the villains don't have anyone
to tie to the tracks

00:07:12.667 --> 00:07:14.701
[ Laughter ]
and, you see,
and now, you see, the villains,

00:07:14.701 --> 00:07:16.467
they're just milling about
in the train station

00:07:16.467 --> 00:07:18.334
[ Laughter ]
with their big head

00:07:18.334 --> 00:07:21.100
and they have a big coil of rope
with no one to tie to anything.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.634
[ Laughter ]
And one of the villains
came up to me,

00:07:23.634 --> 00:07:26.133
tall guy, evil guy,
tears running down his face,

00:07:26.133 --> 00:07:28.634
[ Laughter ]
and then shooting
down his handlebar mustache

00:07:28.634 --> 00:07:29.968
like it was a water slide.

00:07:29.968 --> 00:07:31.133
[ Laughter ]

00:07:31.133 --> 00:07:33.067
Tears flying up and then down.

00:07:33.067 --> 00:07:34.868
[ Laughter ]

00:07:34.868 --> 00:07:37.200
And he said to me, "Sir,

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.567
please make it easier for trains
to explode near communities."

00:07:40.567 --> 00:07:42.033
[ Laughter ]

00:07:42.033 --> 00:07:44.901
So, there's a lot
of actual policy

00:07:44.901 --> 00:07:46.567
Republicans could be discussing
right now,

00:07:46.567 --> 00:07:48.167
like we could force
wealthy companies

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:49.934
to pay for cleanups
after disasters

00:07:49.934 --> 00:07:52.501
or we could impose
stiffer financial penalties,

00:07:52.501 --> 00:07:54.701
we could tax them more
and redistribute that money

00:07:54.701 --> 00:07:56.100
to workers
and safety improvements,

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:58.067
require electric
braking systems.

00:07:58.067 --> 00:08:00.300
Or, maybe,
we could reimpose some

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.200
of those silly
little regulations designed

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:04.300
to, you know,
stop trains from exploding.

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.367
Instead, Republicans,
like Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:08:06.367 --> 00:08:07.400
are saying stuff like this.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.601
-We have people like Ilhan Omar.

00:08:09.601 --> 00:08:10.934
She wants to, you know,

00:08:10.934 --> 00:08:14.267
crack down on corporate greed,
when it comes to rails

00:08:14.267 --> 00:08:16.801
and the privately owned sections
of rails,

00:08:16.801 --> 00:08:18.601
but, really,
what we have to do is we have

00:08:18.601 --> 00:08:20.367
to make sure
that our rails are safe.

00:08:20.367 --> 00:08:21.567
-Now, on one hand,
it makes sense

00:08:21.567 --> 00:08:23.467
that Greene would blame
Ilhan Omar for this,

00:08:23.467 --> 00:08:25.367
because she blames Ilhan Omar
for everything.

00:08:25.367 --> 00:08:28.100
I'm certain, when Marjorie's
name is spelled wrong

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:30.234
on her Starbucks cup, she stares
up at the sky and yells --

00:08:30.234 --> 00:08:31.601
[ As Greene ]
Ilhan!

00:08:31.601 --> 00:08:33.601
[ Laughter ]
Also, I bet the most common

00:08:33.601 --> 00:08:35.868
misspelling of Marjorie she gets
is this --

00:08:35.868 --> 00:08:37.667
[ Laughter ]

00:08:37.667 --> 00:08:40.667
But it is, in fact, possible
to crack down on corporate greed

00:08:40.667 --> 00:08:42.734
and make sure the rails
are safe, especially since...

00:08:46.501 --> 00:08:49.067
...before Trump rolled back
the braking rules.

00:08:49.067 --> 00:08:50.701
And, yet, instead of spending
her time talking

00:08:50.701 --> 00:08:51.934
about any of that,
Greene used part

00:08:51.934 --> 00:08:53.834
of interview on Fox last night
to repeat

00:08:53.834 --> 00:08:55.100
a debunked right-wing
talking point

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:57.167
that windmills
are killing whales.

00:08:57.167 --> 00:08:59.534
-I don't know why
AOC isn't dressed in white

00:08:59.534 --> 00:09:03.467
and crying for the dead whales
that keep washing on the beach

00:09:03.467 --> 00:09:06.367
from wind farms that are being
placed all over the ocean.

00:09:06.367 --> 00:09:08.234
-Now, this conspiracy
theory claims

00:09:08.234 --> 00:09:10.067
the construction
of offshore wind farms

00:09:10.067 --> 00:09:12.334
is fatal to whales,
which there is no evidence of.

00:09:12.334 --> 00:09:14.167
But my first reaction,
when I heard that, was,

00:09:14.167 --> 00:09:16.701
"Does Marjorie Taylor Greene
think whales can fly?"

00:09:16.701 --> 00:09:19.501
[ Laughter ]

00:09:19.501 --> 00:09:21.100
Has she been staring
at the new

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:23.200
unidentified objects
on her computer, saying --

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.300
[ As Greene ]
Enhance!

00:09:24.367 --> 00:09:25.767
Enhance!

00:09:25.834 --> 00:09:27.400
[ Laughter ]
Enhance!

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:28.834
I knew it!

00:09:28.834 --> 00:09:30.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:30.534 --> 00:09:33.300
And that wasn't
the only bizarre take

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.968
Greene had
on the train derailment.

00:09:34.968 --> 00:09:37.133
She unfurled a long
Twitter thread on Monday

00:09:37.133 --> 00:09:38.868
that was supposed to be
about the derailment

00:09:38.868 --> 00:09:41.467
and what caused it,
but she got so far afield that,

00:09:41.467 --> 00:09:44.834
15 tweets into the thread,
here's where she ended up.

00:09:44.834 --> 00:09:46.767
Again, this is
from a Twitter thread

00:09:46.767 --> 00:09:49.133
that was supposed to be
about a train derailment.

00:09:53.133 --> 00:09:54.667
[ Laughter ]

00:09:59.067 --> 00:10:00.534
[ Laughter ]

00:10:02.801 --> 00:10:05.901
[ Laughter ]
No, we definitely are not.

00:10:05.901 --> 00:10:07.100
[ Laughter ]

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:08.601
You think pot had something
to do

00:10:08.601 --> 00:10:10.234
with the train derailment
in Ohio?

00:10:10.234 --> 00:10:12.868
We all know there's only
one train who smokes pot,

00:10:12.868 --> 00:10:15.067
and it's the one narrated
by Ringo Starr.

00:10:15.067 --> 00:10:16.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:16.501 --> 00:10:18.200
I'm on to you, Thomas.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:20.067
[ Laughter ]

00:10:21.701 --> 00:10:23.701
[ Laughter ]

00:10:23.701 --> 00:10:26.334
"You guys, do I have like
a human face?"

00:10:26.334 --> 00:10:30.033
[ Laughter ]

00:10:30.033 --> 00:10:32.100
And, somehow, she wasn't
the only conservative

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:33.467
to bring up marijuana

00:10:33.467 --> 00:10:35.167
in the context
of the train derailment.

00:10:35.167 --> 00:10:37.834
Fox host Laura Ingraham
had this to say in a monologue

00:10:37.834 --> 00:10:40.434
about what she called
the real environmental killers.

00:10:40.434 --> 00:10:42.634
-And then there's
drug legalization.

00:10:42.634 --> 00:10:44.467
Liberals pushed
to legalize marijuana.

00:10:44.467 --> 00:10:47.634
High THC content,
and even hard drugs,

00:10:47.634 --> 00:10:51.334
is an unfolding societal
and environmental disaster.

00:10:51.334 --> 00:10:53.534
-How is pot use
an environmental disaster?

00:10:53.534 --> 00:10:55.801
If anything, pot smoke
promotes appreciation

00:10:55.801 --> 00:10:57.334
of the natural world.
Have you ever gotten high

00:10:57.334 --> 00:10:59.234
and seen a rainbow?
It'll blow your goddamn mind.

00:10:59.234 --> 00:11:02.534
[ Laughter ]
I guarantee, if Laura Ingraham
took one bong rip

00:11:02.534 --> 00:11:04.300
and then laid down on a blanket
under the stars

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.133
in a national park,
she'd move to Santa Monica,

00:11:06.133 --> 00:11:07.567
wear a beanie,
and join Greenpeace.

00:11:07.567 --> 00:11:09.767
[ Laughter ]

00:11:09.767 --> 00:11:11.501
Republicans seem to have
no real solutions

00:11:11.501 --> 00:11:13.667
for a situation like
the train derailment in Ohio,

00:11:13.667 --> 00:11:15.033
other than culture war nonsense.

00:11:15.033 --> 00:11:17.934
Take Ohio Senator J.D. Vance,
who said this on Fox --

00:11:17.934 --> 00:11:19.334
-The problem we have, Tucker,

00:11:19.334 --> 00:11:21.968
is that we are ruled
by unserious people

00:11:21.968 --> 00:11:23.868
who are worried
about fake problems,

00:11:23.868 --> 00:11:26.934
instead of the real fact that
our country is falling apart

00:11:26.934 --> 00:11:28.701
in some of the most
important ways.

00:11:28.701 --> 00:11:30.567
You mentioned the Environmental
Protection Agency.

00:11:30.567 --> 00:11:31.901
Of course,
it says it right there --

00:11:31.901 --> 00:11:34.400
it should be focused
on clean air, clean water.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:36.267
It's the thing that
I'm most focused on

00:11:36.267 --> 00:11:37.667
for the people
of East Palestine,

00:11:37.667 --> 00:11:41.534
but, so often, they're focused
on environmental racism

00:11:41.534 --> 00:11:45.267
and other ridiculous things,
instead of fixing the problem

00:11:45.267 --> 00:11:47.100
that they are established
to fix.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.501
-I'm sorry,
you think Democrats are

00:11:48.501 --> 00:11:50.701
unserious people,
worried about fake problems?

00:11:50.701 --> 00:11:52.634
On that exact same network,
a day later,

00:11:52.634 --> 00:11:55.267
a lady in your party said whales
are getting killed by windmills.

00:11:55.267 --> 00:11:58.601
[ Laughter ]
Now, Tucker, instead of worrying
about fake problems,

00:11:58.601 --> 00:11:59.734
like environmental racism,

00:11:59.734 --> 00:12:01.300
we need to be focused
on real problems,

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:03.467
like how solar panels
are frying bald eagles

00:12:03.467 --> 00:12:04.834
like rotisserie chickens.

00:12:04.834 --> 00:12:06.367
[ Laughter ]

00:12:06.367 --> 00:12:08.634
And, by the way, good faith
criticism of Democrats

00:12:08.634 --> 00:12:10.767
would be fine.
They're the ones in power.

00:12:10.767 --> 00:12:13.767
It is very fair to hold their
feet to the fire about this.

00:12:13.767 --> 00:12:16.100
It took Transportation Secretary
Pete Buttigieg ten days

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.400
to tweet about the disaster

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.901
and Biden hasn't yet committed

00:12:18.901 --> 00:12:21.167
to reinstating the safety rule
Trump repealed.

00:12:21.167 --> 00:12:22.734
And that dude loves trains!

00:12:22.734 --> 00:12:24.667
[ Laughter ]
I would think, if a train went
off the rails

00:12:24.667 --> 00:12:26.033
anywhere in America,

00:12:26.033 --> 00:12:28.968
Amtrak Joe would sit bolt
upright in bed in a cold sweat.

00:12:28.968 --> 00:12:30.100
[ Laughter ]

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:31.534
I mean, come on, dude!

00:12:31.534 --> 00:12:33.167
The one thing Biden voters
thought they could count on was

00:12:33.167 --> 00:12:34.934
for you to be on top
of the train stuff!

00:12:34.934 --> 00:12:35.968
[ Laughter ]

00:12:35.968 --> 00:12:37.334
When Bill Clinton was president,

00:12:37.334 --> 00:12:39.868
there wasn't a single
saxophone-related disaster!

00:12:39.868 --> 00:12:41.534
[ Laughter ]

00:12:41.534 --> 00:12:43.400
Well, other than the time
he played it.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.834
[ Laughter and ohhs ]

00:12:45.834 --> 00:12:47.701
[ As Clinton ]
I think I'm going to walk
seven miles tonight.

00:12:47.701 --> 00:12:48.734
I'm probably safe.

00:12:48.734 --> 00:12:50.300
[ Laughter ]

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:52.300
Did I do Jimmy Carter, instead
of Bill Clinton, I think.

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:54.367
[ Laughter ]

00:12:54.367 --> 00:12:56.701
[ Italian accent ]
Hey, I'm from Dallas!

00:12:56.701 --> 00:12:59.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:59.467 --> 00:13:00.834
Some nights,
you can't find it, guys.

00:13:00.834 --> 00:13:02.934
[ Laughter ]

00:13:02.934 --> 00:13:04.868
The important thing --

00:13:04.868 --> 00:13:06.033
The important thing is
it all happened

00:13:06.033 --> 00:13:07.934
because we wanted
to burn him for that.

00:13:07.934 --> 00:13:10.634
[ Laughter ]

00:13:10.634 --> 00:13:13.467
Ah, well, there we go.

00:13:13.467 --> 00:13:14.634
[ Laughter ]

00:13:14.634 --> 00:13:16.868
You guys, you know what's fun
is sometimes

00:13:16.868 --> 00:13:18.467
this all happens and I look over

00:13:18.467 --> 00:13:20.868
and Wally is just very
passive-aggressively tapping

00:13:20.868 --> 00:13:21.901
where I am on the card.

00:13:21.901 --> 00:13:25.601
[ Laughter ]

00:13:25.601 --> 00:13:27.467
But Republicans aren't talking
about substance.

00:13:27.467 --> 00:13:29.067
They're talking
about culture war nonsense,

00:13:29.067 --> 00:13:30.801
like marijuana
and environmental racism,

00:13:30.801 --> 00:13:31.901
because the conservative
movement

00:13:31.901 --> 00:13:33.200
has no real policy agenda.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.100
They have nothing concrete
to offer

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:37.234
and that can be best summed up
by this ridiculous clip

00:13:37.234 --> 00:13:39.334
from yesterday, where
a White House correspondent

00:13:39.334 --> 00:13:41.467
for the conservative network
Newsmax

00:13:41.467 --> 00:13:42.901
asked this absurd question.

00:13:42.901 --> 00:13:45.467
-One of the most prominent
themes that we hear,

00:13:45.467 --> 00:13:50.634
from both elected Republicans
and candidates,

00:13:50.634 --> 00:13:55.634
has to do with
what is called wokeism.

00:13:55.634 --> 00:13:58.901
I wonder if we couldn't begin
with a threshold question --

00:13:58.901 --> 00:14:02.334
to wit,
is President Biden woke?

00:14:02.334 --> 00:14:03.901
[ Laughter ]
-I'm sorry,

00:14:03.901 --> 00:14:05.000
I don't have my glasses on.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.834
Is that Woodward or Bernstein?

00:14:06.834 --> 00:14:08.868
[ Laughter ]

00:14:08.868 --> 00:14:10.601
Also, you think Joe Biden
is woke?

00:14:10.601 --> 00:14:13.334
If it's past 5:00 pm,
he's probably not even awake,

00:14:13.334 --> 00:14:15.267
let alone woke.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:15.267 --> 00:14:18.400
"Is Joe Biden woke?" has to be
one of the dumbest questions

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.300
ever asked at a White House
press conference,

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:22.334
and I'm including the time
a reporter asked

00:14:22.334 --> 00:14:24.501
if windmills should be illegal,
although personally,

00:14:24.501 --> 00:14:26.501
I thought the reporter
looked a little suspicious.

00:14:26.501 --> 00:14:29.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.067
"To wit."

00:14:30.067 --> 00:14:33.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:33.667 --> 00:14:35.434
The catastrophic
train derailment

00:14:35.434 --> 00:14:37.067
and ensuing
environmental disaster

00:14:37.067 --> 00:14:38.834
are a perfect example
of the kind of thing

00:14:38.834 --> 00:14:41.267
a serious governing party
should have answers for.

00:14:41.267 --> 00:14:44.567
Absolutely true, the Democrats
can and should do more.

00:14:44.567 --> 00:14:47.434
Meanwhile, Republicans are
talking about culture war BS

00:14:47.434 --> 00:14:49.000
and whales getting killed
by windmills,

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.701
like they all took a huge hit
of...

00:14:50.701 --> 00:14:51.701
-Marijuana.

00:14:51.701 --> 00:14:52.501
[ Laughter ]
-This has been

00:14:52.501 --> 00:14:53.567
"A Closer Look."

00:14:53.567 --> 00:14:57.434
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

